        "slc_f635c4e28478093de6b68bc3873870659388779265c474e469b3656e085e4d63"
      ],
      "text": "Built-in panels include a multi-tab PTY terminal backed by native shell processes, an embedded browser, git staging/commit/push with worktree support, and AI-generated commit messages from the staged diff."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c430cce67ac5dfb5d3d8fe15af8c438cf6ed71b41416a81b3407163f4ecf20d9",
