          "url": "https://github.com/OpenSource03/harnss/blob/dc1dfd8a33caa46a1eefcfe9e14697b27ac4c33d/README.md#L109-L109"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_84c134d6727d5f139e258dae1219e55b9ba8af601b66c9d06da9085ed3da27fd"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions, history, and panel settings are scoped per project; projects map to disk folders and can be grouped into named Spaces with custom icons and colors."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_21735609f7c09dfc9e6248cfd20a40acde943779b9e55ce09338c54a7bd52b6a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "dc1dfd8a33caa46a1eefcfe9e14697b27ac4c33d",
          "git_sha": "006b4653872e403813be4a852a3a3f3261c676c8",
          "line_end": 129,
          "line_start": 129,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "opensource03/harnss",
          "url": "https://github.com/OpenSource03/harnss/blob/dc1dfd8a33caa46a1eefcfe9e14697b27ac4c33d/README.md#L129-L129"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_62f91f091a608f3c14f759fc2aa0d4ddc29cb8ae00e32a9b7db5ea1b60ecb13d"
      ],
      "text": "Voice input is supported via native macOS dictation or an on-device Whisper model requiring no API key, alongside configurable OS notifications for approvals, permission prompts, and session events."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_51f068d7ff7e96dfac712ab7556441697e9100da1fc38e99119e81ffd7aa08b7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
